        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JIe3xDzdQSW75EDT2ME36iqBvws=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-19037-Dessert-Crepes-DDMFS-4x3-step-02-71a36f6748694afdbfed70bc4c4746c5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19037/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a medium skillet or crêpe pan over medium heat. Grease the pan with a small amount of butter or oil applied with a brush or paper towel.",
